<div class="callout"><p class="callout-title">Writing a letter of application</p><ol><li>Your address and the date (top right), the employer’s address (left).</li><li>Dear Sir / Dear Madam (or Dear Mr Diallo).</li><li>Paragraph 1: the job you are applying for and where you saw the advertisement.</li><li>Paragraph 2: your qualifications and experience.</li><li>Paragraph 3: why you want the job; your availability for an interview.</li><li>Yours faithfully (if you began with Dear Sir) or Yours sincerely (with a name), then your signature.</li></ol></div>$html$);
