insert into public.lesson_bodies (lesson_id, body_html) values ((select id from public.lessons where chapter_id = (select c.id from public.chapters c where c.program_id = (select p.id from public.programs p join public.subjects s on s.id = p.subject_id join public.levels l on l.id = p.level_id where s.code = 'ANG' and l.code = 'TLE' and p.series_id = (select id from public.series where code = 'L2')) and c.slug = 'education') and slug = 'traditional-and-modern-education'), $html$<h2>Reading: Learning under the tree</h2><p>In traditional African societies, children learned from their elders through stories, proverbs, initiation and work. Education was the responsibility of the whole community.</p><p>Today, school is compulsory, but many children still leave school early. Some people think that modern education should teach both academic knowledge and the values of the past.</p>
