insert into public.lesson_bodies (lesson_id, body_html) values ((select id from public.lessons where chapter_id = (select c.id from public.chapters c where c.program_id = (select p.id from public.programs p join public.subjects s on s.id = p.subject_id join public.levels l on l.id = p.level_id where s.code = 'ANG' and l.code = 'TLE' and p.series_id = (select id from public.series where code = 'LA')) and c.slug = 'free-time-and-entertainment') and slug = 'hobbies-sports-and-entertainment'), $html$<h2>Reading: Wrestling, more than a sport</h2><p>In Senegal, traditional wrestling (laamb) is the most popular sport. Before a fight, wrestlers dance, sing and perform rituals, and griots praise them with drums. Big fights fill the national arena and are watched on television by millions of fans.</p><p>Young people also enjoy football, basketball, music and social media. Leisure activities help us relax, meet people and discover new talents.</p>
